Package: musickitr
Title: Tidy Access to the Apple Music API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("David", "Brocker", email = "davidabrocker@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tidy, tibble-based access to the Apple Music Catalog
    API (search, charts, artists, albums, songs) plus a few similarity
    utilities useful for building music recommendation and matchup
    tools. Users must bring their own MusicKit developer credentials
    (Team ID, Key ID, and private key) from an active Apple Developer
    Program membership.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    openssl,
    dplyr,
    tibble,
    purrr,
    rlang
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    ggplot2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/DavidBrocker/musickitr
BugReports: https://github.com/DavidBrocker/musickitr/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
